            "review_text": "Hoang Tour Guide\nNorway9 contributions\n0\nSo Amazing\nApr 2025 • Friends\nI visited this place on a beautiful day. It can be said that this is the beer bar with the most beautiful view of Quy Nhon. Everything is so relaxing. I met the homie brothers. We went from strangers to acquaintances. We drank beer together, smoked together, watched the city and enjoyed delicious food. The bar also has rock and indie rock music nights. The singers and bands sing very well. The space is vibrant and fun. I find it suitable for friends from all over the world to gather here. Will come back many more times.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nshould book in advance to get a good location\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 15, 2025",
